-#
  "Automation on / paused" badge of the Season board header (inside the <summary> of the switches): its id is a
  target of the turbo-stream answer of AutomationController#switch.
- paused = DataFix::Automation.paused?
%span.badge#season-board-automation-badge{ class: paused ? 'text-bg-warning' : 'text-bg-success',
                                           data: { automation_paused: paused.to_s } }
  = t(paused ? 'pipeline_automation.board.paused' : 'pipeline_automation.board.on')
